:::text id=fNchNYiE-9 at=top-center width=86% height=120 preset=title align=center
# Rules of Engagement — Pet Peeves & Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=W-0rLLz8NN at=center width=480 height=400 offsetX=-256 offsetY=64 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::text id=ozi4Fdz25z at=center width=424 height=40 offsetX=-256 offsetY=-96 preset=caption align=center color=#DC2626
PET PEEVES
:::

:::text id=B5_94crorT at=center width=424 height=288 offsetX=-256 offsetY=80 preset=body align=left color=text
- **Unscheduled communication** for non-urgent matters.
- **Refusal of ideas** or proposals without clear reasons.
:::

:::shape id=4Hj6BENBBR at=center width=480 height=400 offsetX=264 offsetY=64 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::text id=-GidwZa8ml at=center width=424 height=40 offsetX=264 offsetY=-96 preset=caption align=center color=#166534
GOLDEN RULES
:::

:::text id=YBuCFGA89N at=center width=424 height=288 offsetX=264 offsetY=80 preset=body align=left color=text
- **Notify me beforehand** for synchronous check-ins.
- **Give reasons** for idea/proposal refusal, and optionally suggest alternatives.
:::
